{"id":"28f002080d71355a","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-ring-homomorphism.md","title":"Ring Homomorphism","display":"df-ring-homomorphism — Ring Homomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ring-homomorphism","aliases":["58-df-ring-homomorphism"],"display":"df-ring-homomorphism — Ring Homomorphism","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ring-homomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ring-homomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ring-homomorphism — Ring Homomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,S,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S,f\\in V\">\\(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,S,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ring}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\operatorname{Ring}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RingHom}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\">\\(\\mathrm{RingHom}_S\\subseteq V^{11}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ring\\text{-}homomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{RingHom}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,S,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\land\\operatorname{Ring}_S(S,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,R,S)\\land f(0_R)=0_S\\land f(1_R)=1_S\\land\\forall x,y\\in R\\;(f(x+_Ry)=f(x)+_Sf(y)\\land f(x\\cdot_Ry)=f(x)\\cdot_Sf(y))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ring\\text{-}homomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{RingHom}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,S,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\land\\operatorname{Ring}_S(S,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,R,S)\\land f(0_R)=0_S\\land f(1_R)=1_S\\land\\forall x,y\\in R\\;(f(x+_Ry)=f(x)+_Sf(y)\\land f(x\\cdot_Ry)=f(x)\\cdot_Sf(y))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ring homomorphisms preserve addition, multiplication, zero, and one.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ring}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]) and $\\mathrm{RingHom}_S\\subseteq V^{11}$","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,S,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ring}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RingHom}_S\\subseteq V^{11}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ring\\text{-}homomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{RingHom}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,S,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\land\\operatorname{Ring}_S(S,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,R,S)\\land f(0_R)=0_S\\land f(1_R)=1_S\\land\\forall x,y\\in R\\;(f(x+_Ry)=f(x)+_Sf(y)\\land f(x\\cdot_Ry)=f(x)\\cdot_Sf(y))","display":true}],"bytes":976,"backlinks":[{"id":"32a5d2d48a46147b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RingHom}_S\\subseteq V^{11}$ (structured unital ring-homomorphism predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-ring-homomorphism.md]])"},{"id":"6114f5d4fdd10493","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RingHom}_S$ (ring-homomorphism predicate, see [[58-df-ring-homomorphism]])"},{"id":"52a24e9e2d9da02e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RingHom}_S\\subseteq V^{11}$ (ring-homomorphism predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-ring-homomorphism.md]])"},{"id":"9466be9df2f5cd8c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"873303ae0d44ae55","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"024b72650b2c1368","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1099","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-ring-homomorphism.md|58-df-ring-homomorphism]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["1c30d21ea7b443f6","36d7463d215be751"]}